  "description": "Audit-event retention observability (ADR-091 D20.4, ADR-075). Three panels mirror the three-signal triage in docs/runbooks/FaasAuditRetentionExhaustion.md: (1) daily prune rate (apid_audit_events_deleted_total — counter, only ticks on passes where deleted > 0 per pkg/eventretention/cleanup.go:205-210; idle days stay flat at 0), (2) retention lag in days with green/yellow/red threshold bands at 89-91d healthy (the gauge reads ~90d on every healthy pass because pkg/eventretention/cleanup.go:198-199 sets cutoff = now - 90d and line 211-213 Sets the gauge to now - cutoff, so values outside the band mean clock skew or CutoffDays misconfiguration), (3) emit volume by kind_prefix (topk(8, ...) clamp survives the bounded-admission helper in pkg/wire/metrics.go that collapses overflow to __other__). Companion alerts live at deploy/ansible/roles/prometheus/files/faas.rules.yml under family: audit_retention — FaasAuditRetentionLoopStalled (page) on gauge staleness, FaasAuditRetentionLoopStretched (warn) at 50h, FaasAuditRetentionTableGrowingFasterThanPruned (warn) on volume-vs-deleted divergence.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Audit events pruned / 24h",
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(apid_audit_events_deleted_total[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "rows pruned",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Retention lag (days, healthy: 89-91)",
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "apid_audit_events_retention_lag_seconds / 86400",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
